<plist version="1.0"><dict>
<key>items</key><array>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string><key>label</key><string>充电模式说明</string><key>footerText</key><string>普通充电上限：达到上限后暂停，降到回充下限后恢复。夜间计划：限充时间后充至70%暂停；恢复时间后解除夜间阻止，继续充至100%。智能停充使用阻止外部供电，夜间计划和温控使用阻止充电。</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string><key>label</key><string>启用智能停充</string><key>key</key><string>smartChargeEnable</string><key>default</key><false/><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string><key>footerText</key><string>不使用夜间计划时，按下面的充电上限和回充下限运行。</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string><key>label</key><string>日夜自动切换</string><key>key</key><string>chargeDayNightAutoEnable</string><key>default</key><false/><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string><key>footerText</key><string>默认关闭。白天开启智能停充、关闭夜间计划；夜间开启夜间计划、关闭智能停充。自动开启后手动切换会按当前时段立即重判。</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>白天开始时间</string><key>key</key><string>chargeDayStartHour</string><key>default</key><integer>8</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>夜间开始时间</string><key>key</key><string>chargeNightStartHour</string><key>default</key><integer>22</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>普通模式：停止充电上限</string><key>key</key><string>smartChargeUpperLimit</string><key>default</key><integer>80</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>普通模式：恢复充电下限</string><key>key</key><string>smartChargeLowerLimit</string><key>default</key><integer>70</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string><key>label</key><string>夜间分时充电计划</string><key>footerText</key><string>限充时间开始后解除夜间阻止，充至70%后暂停；恢复时间到达后再次解除夜间阻止，继续充至100%。时间可自行设置，每30分钟一个选项。最终恢复时若温控或手动阻止仍开启，它们仍会独立生效。</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string><key>label</key><string>启用夜间分时充电计划</string><key>key</key><string>chargeScheduleEnabled</string><key>default</key><false/><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string><key>footerText</key><string>不需要同时开启“普通充电上限”；开启后夜间计划优先执行。</string></dict>
<dict><key>cell</key><string>PSTitleValueCell</string><key>action</key><string>selectScheduleValue:</string><key>label</key><string>限充开始（目标70%）</string><key>key</key><string>chargeScheduleStartHour</string><key>default</key><integer>22</integer><key>get</key><string>getPreferenceValue:</string><key>set</key><string>setPreferenceValue:specifier:</string></dict>
